.TH CHM-TOOLCHAINS 1
.SH NAME
chm-toolchains \- install and verify open compiler and debugger toolchains
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bash tools/toolchains/bootstrap-open-toolchains.sh
.I list|install|verify
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists, installs or verifies reviewed open-source compilers, assemblers, linkers,
disassemblers, debuggers and QEMU user-mode runners. Debian/Ubuntu installation checks
repository availability and reports unavailable packages rather than fabricating binaries.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success; 64 for invalid arguments; 69 if no supported package manager or packages
are available; 77 if privilege escalation is unavailable.
